<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Random Teleport</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 22)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast random teleport</a>   (on yourself only)
</pre>
<p>Takes you to a random place somewhere in the world, any land at all. You can 
cast it in the middle of a fight, which makes it a desperate way out: you'll 
be gone, but you won't know where to. If the place it picks is one magic 
can't reach, or you stand where magic can't take you away, it fails.
</p><p>Beware the rift: about one cast in twenty tears a hole in the powers of 
magic. All your mana is gone, and you may be thrown somewhere else, into the 
void, or something may come through the rift at you.
</p><p>It is also found on scrolls and wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
